WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.911
Farmer was asleep.

2
00:00:07.912 --> 00:00:14.505
He filled the hammock.

3
00:00:14.506 --> 00:00:23.375
There was no room for Cat.

4
00:00:23.376 --> 00:00:29.156
Cat jumped up.

5
00:00:29.157 --> 00:00:33.032
Farmer snored.

6
00:00:33.033 --> 00:00:37.957
Cat walked on Farmer's feet.

7
00:00:37.958 --> 00:00:41.149
Farmer snored.

8
00:00:41.150 --> 00:00:45.997
Cat walked on Farmer's legs.

9
00:00:45.998 --> 00:00:49.237
Farmer snored some more.

10
00:00:49.238 --> 00:00:54.717
Cat walked on Farmer's chest.

11
00:00:54.718 --> 00:00:58.075
Farmer almost woke up.

12
00:00:58.076 --> 00:01:04.247
Cat walked on Farmer's head.

13
00:01:04.248 --> 00:01:06.871
Farmer sat up.

14
00:01:06.872 --> 00:01:10.058
Cat hid.

15
00:01:10.059 --> 00:01:14.859
Farmer looked at his watch.

16
00:01:14.860 --> 00:01:18.126
"It's three o'clock!" he said.

17
00:01:18.127 --> 00:01:20.814
"I have work to do!"

18
00:01:20.815 --> 00:01:23.340
Farmer got off the hammock.

19
00:01:23.341 --> 00:01:26.389
He went to the barn.

20
00:01:26.390 --> 00:01:31.630
Cat jumped back up.

21
00:01:31.631 --> 00:01:36.238
She curled up in the hammock.

22
00:01:36.239 --> 00:01:47.111
Cat went to sleep.

23
00:01:47.112 --> 00:01:51.344
But then she woke up.

24
00:01:51.345 --> 00:01:53.505
Cat saw Dog.

25
00:01:53.506 --> 00:02:00.008
"Can I sleep here too?" he asked.

